    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "What people did (last 24h)",
      "description": "Actions people took, counted over a trailing day and refreshed from the database, so a restart of the portal does not read as everyone stopping work. Only what a person did: the reconcile loop and auto-discovery write to the same journals and are left out.",
